---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Main from '../../layouts/Main.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import LinkButton from '../../components/LinkButton.astro';
import Hr from "../../components/Hr.astro";
import SvgIcon from '../../components/SvgIcon.astro';
import { TREE_STATS } from "../../config";

// Replace these with your real photography once available.
// Suggested shots: guests actively planting (hands in soil), a wide shot of
// open/degraded ground within Ngubi ready for planting, a nursery seedling
// tray shot (from KFT or Uplands), and a group/corporate team shot from a
// past planting day if you have one.
import HeroImg from '/public/images/tree-planting-guests2.webp';
import SourcingImg from '/public/images/tree-planting-nursery.webp';
import PlantingDayImg from '/public/images/tree-planting-guests.webp';
---

<Layout title="Tree Planting Partnerships - Ngubi Adventure Forest Camp">
  <Header />
  <Main pageTitle="" pageDesc="" class="bg-surface text-foreground">

    {/* --- HERO --- */}
    <section class="relative min-h-[70vh] flex flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden pb-10 sm:pb-16">
      <img
        src={HeroImg.src}
        alt="Tree planting at Ngubi Forest"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/85 via-black/30 to-black/10"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-app mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 w-full">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 text-white/80 hover:text-white text-sm font-medium">
          ← Home
        </a>
        <span class="inline-block mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white bg-accent px-3 py-1 rounded-full w-fit">
          Conservation Partnership
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white max-w-3xl mb-4 [text-shadow:_0_2px_10px_rgb(0_0_0_/_60%)]">
          Tree Planting at Ngubi Forest
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/90 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          A tree planting partnership for individuals, groups, organisations and institutions,
          based in Ngubi Forest and supported by Kenya Forest Service and Kijabe Forest Trust.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- OPENING NARRATIVE: THE STAKES --- */}
    <section class="py-10 sm:py-14">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground-light-bg mb-5">
          Kenya's forest cover has been below the level the country needs for a long time. As of
          2021 it stood at under 9 percent, below the 10 percent minimum set out in the
          Constitution. In response, the government has committed to planting 15 billion trees
          by 2032, which would bring national tree cover to 30 percent and restore 10.6 million
          hectares of degraded land.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground-light-bg mb-5">
          Reaching that target not only depends on how many go into the ground, but on whether the trees planted survive long enough to
          become forest. This is something monitoring
          groups have already raised; there is a gap between seedlings planted and trees that
          actually take root, and it is the part that is harder to see and to track.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground-light-bg">
          When we approached the Kenya Forest Service for support, they advised us to plan in
          thousands rather than in tens or hundreds, since planting at that scale, done in
          phases, is more likely to add up to real, lasting forest cover. We have built our
          tree planting partnership around that advice.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- WHO THIS IS FOR: CORPORATE FIRST --- */}
    <section class="py-10 sm:py-14 bg-surface-alt">
      <div class="max-w-app mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-accent mb-4">For Corporate and CSR Partners</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
            Tree planting has become a common item on CSR and ESG calendars, and increasingly
            an item people ask questions about. At Ngubi, your organisation plants in a
            specific, named part of Ngubi Forest, on a documented planting day, with partners
            who can confirm what happens to the trees afterward.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md border-t-4 border-accent">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">A Specific Location</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
              Your trees are planted at marked locations in Ngubi Forest, and you can
              return with your team and see the same ground again.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md border-t-4 border-accent">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Planting at Scale</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
              We plan planting days in the thousands phased across the year, in line with
              KFS recommendations.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md border-t-4 border-accent">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Can Be Combined With Other Activities</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
              A planting day can be paired with team building, a guided forest walk, or an
              overnight stay at our camp.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- SOURCING STORY --- */}
    <section class="max-w-app mx-auto px-4 py-10 sm:py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:space-x-10">
      <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-8 md:mb-0 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg aspect-w-4 aspect-h-3">
        <img src={SourcingImg.src} alt="Seedling nursery near Ngubi Forest" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
      <div class="md:w-1/2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-accent mb-4">Where Our Seedlings Come From</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We do not yet grow our own seedlings. We source them from two established nurseries who
          already know this forest.
        </p>
        <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <strong class="text-foreground">Kijabe Forest Trust</strong>, our community
          conservation partner, runs a nursery and restoration team across their roughly
          6,000-hectare focal area of the Kikuyu Escarpment. Their seedlings are indigenous
          species, grown for this specific forest.
        </p>
        <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-foreground">Uplands Forest Station</strong>, the Kenya Forest
          Service station Ngubi operates inside, propagates seedlings at larger volumes. Between the two, each
          planting day is matched to seedlings suited to that particular ground.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- THE PLANTING DAY --- */}
    <section class="max-w-app mx-auto px-4 py-10 sm:py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center md:space-x-reverse md:space-x-10">
      <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-8 md:mb-0 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg aspect-w-4 aspect-h-3">
        <img src={PlantingDayImg.src} alt="Guests planting trees at Ngubi Forest" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
      <div class="md:w-1/2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-accent mb-4">What Happens on a Planting Day</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          A planting day at Ngubi is guided. Your group is taken to the specific section of
          forest set aside for that day, briefed on what is being planted and why, and given
          the tools and direction needed to plant properly.
        </p>
        <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
          It can also be combined with our other services, with many  groups adding a
          planting session onto a team-building activity or an overnight camp.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- CAPACITY / ROOM TO GROW --- */}
    <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-accent">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center text-white">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-white/80 mb-3">Room to Grow</p>
        <p class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold mb-4">{TREE_STATS.ngubiHectares.toLocaleString()} Hectares</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-white/90 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          This is the size of the Ngubi block within Uplands Forest Station, our home ground.
          Not all of it is under tree cover yet. Between open ground, thinning plantation
          areas, and land set aside for restoration, there is space here for a partnership to
          grow into over several years. We welcome partners who want to
          help fill that space.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- OUR PROGRESS: THREE STAGES --- */}
    <section class="py-10 sm:py-14">
      <div class="max-w-app mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-accent mb-3">Where We Are Right Now</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">

          {/* Stage 1: So far */}
          <div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-accent mb-2">So Far</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-2">{TREE_STATS.plantedSinceJan.toLocaleString()}+</p>
            <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
              Trees planted with campers, schools, and visiting groups since January 2026.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Stage 2: Mid-term */}
          <div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-accent mb-2">By {TREE_STATS.midTermLabel}</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-2">{TREE_STATS.midTermTarget.toLocaleString()}+</p>
            <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
              Our first forest trail run takes place on Mazingira Day, 10 October 2026, and we
              are working toward {TREE_STATS.midTermTarget.toLocaleString()} trees planted by the same day in 2027.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Stage 3: Long-term */}
          <div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-accent mb-2">By {TREE_STATS.longTermLabel}</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-2">{TREE_STATS.longTermTarget.toLocaleString()}</p>
            <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed">
              By 2035, our tenth year, we are working toward {TREE_STATS.longTermTarget.toLocaleString()} trees planted with our partners.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- PARTNERS STRIP --- */}
    <section class="py-10 bg-surface-alt">
      <div class="max-w-app mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-foreground-light-bg mb-6">Backed By</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8">
          <img src="/images/partner-kfs.webp" alt="Kenya Forest Service" class="h-16 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/partner-kijabe.webp" alt="Kijabe Forest Trust" class="h-16 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Hr />

    {/* --- FINAL CTA --- */}
    <section class="py-12 sm:py-16">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-accent mb-4">Plant Trees With Us</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground-light-bg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Every partnership starts with a conversation, not a form. Call or WhatsApp us to talk
          through numbers, dates, and what fits your group — or download our partner guide for
          the full picture, including packages and costs, to share with your own team.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          
            <!-- <LinkButton
            href="/documents/Ngubi_Tree_Planting_Partner_Guide.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-block px-8 py-4 text-lg bg-accent text-white rounded-full font-semibold whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-accent-dark transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
            ariaLabel="Download the Tree Planting Partner Guide PDF"
            title="Download the Partner Guide"
          >
            Download Partner Guide (PDF)
          </LinkButton> -->

          <LinkButton
            href="https://wa.me/254712505845?text=Hi! I'm interested in a tree planting partnership at Ngubi."
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-block px-8 py-4 text-lg bg-white text-accent border-2 border-accent rounded-full font-semibold whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
            ariaLabel="Send a WhatsApp Inquiry"
            title="Send Inquiry (WhatsApp)"
          >
            Send Inquiry (WhatsApp)
          </LinkButton>
          <LinkButton
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-block px-8 py-4 text-lg bg-surface text-accent rounded-full font-semibold whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
            ariaLabel="Contact Us"
            title="Contact Us"
          >
            Contact Us
          </LinkButton>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </Main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
